---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return [
    {
      params: { slug: 'cloud-native-hmis-transforming-healthcare-2026' },
      props: {
        title: 'How Cloud-Native HMIS Is Transforming Healthcare Operations in 2026',
        category: 'Hospital IT',
        author: 'Naman Mishra',
        date: 'November 10, 2026',
        content: `
          <p class="lead text-lg text-slate-200 mb-6">Modern hospitals can no longer afford the downtime, sluggish latency, and server hardware failure associated with legacy client-server software. In 2026, healthcare institutions are rapidly migrating to Cloudflare Workers-powered architectures that deliver sub-10ms response times across outpatient counters, emergency rooms, and OT scheduling desks.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. Zero On-Premise Server Maintenance Overhead</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-4">Traditionally, a 100-bed hospital was forced to purchase expensive on-premise rack servers, uninterrupted power supply units, and hire dedicated server technicians to prevent operating system crashes. With Cloudflare-native architecture, compute runs distributed at edge locations worldwide, completely removing hardware vulnerability.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. Direct Laboratory Analyzer Interfacing (ASTM & HL7)</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-4">Connecting biochemistry and hematology analyzers directly with the electronic health record eliminates transcription errors. Blood samples with barcodes are read automatically, verified by pathologists digitally, and dispatched to patients over WhatsApp within seconds.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">3. NABH Compliant Digital Audit Trails</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-4">Quality accreditation requires strict immutable tracking: who prescribed a medication, when it was dispensed, and when the nurse administered it. Our HMIS maintains cryptographic audit logs for every interaction.</p>
        `,
      },
    },
    {
      params: { slug: 'business-automation-competitive-edge' },
      props: {
        title: 'Why Business Automation Is the Single Biggest Competitive Edge',
        category: 'Automation',
        author: 'Naman Mishra',
        date: 'November 12, 2026',
        content: `
          <p class="lead text-lg text-slate-200 mb-6">Stop doing manually what machines can do instantly. In every business, hundreds of hours are lost each month to repetitive tasks: manually creating invoices, calling leads that came through website forms 48 hours late, and answering the same customer support questions over and over.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. The Rule of Sub-Minute Response Times</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-4">Studies consistently reveal that reaching out to an inbound quote or demo request within 5 minutes results in an 800% higher conversion rate compared to contacting them hours later. Digikhojindia's automation engine triggers CRM lead creation, sales WhatsApp alerts, and introductory collateral dispatch immediately.</p>
          
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. Flawless Billing & Payment Recovery</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-4">Unpaid invoices drain cash flow. Automated reminder triggers politely notify clients before due dates and provide direct payment links, reducing overdue accounts receivable by up to 60%.</p>
        `,
      },
    },
  ];
}

const { title, category, author, date, content } = Astro.props;

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": title,
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": author,
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Digikhojindia",
  },
  "datePublished": date,
};
---

<Layout title={`${title} | Digikhojindia`} schema={articleSchema}>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400">{category}</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mt-3 mb-4">
        {title}
      </h1>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
        <span>By <strong class="text-slate-200">{author}</strong></span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>{date}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl">
      <Fragment set:html={content} />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href="/blog" class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-400 hover:underline">
        ← Back to All Articles
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

